## 1. Project Overview & Architecture
The Weather Station project is built upon a robust, layered embedded architecture ensuring high modularity, scalability, and reusability. 
- **MCAL:** Direct hardware register access and peripheral configuration.
- **HAL:** Abstraction of external peripherals (LCD, Keypad).
- **Service Layer:** Middleware and data processing logic.
- **Application (`src`):** Core application loop (`main.c`) handling real-time sensor polling and display updates.

